---
import Replay from "./Replay.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---
<section class="hero shell" id="top">
  <div class="hero__content">
    <span class="eyebrow">Axiom / dynamic graph infrastructure</span>
    <h1>Keep the graph.<br /><span>Keep it moving.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero__sub">Durable, deterministic maximal matching for changing graphs. Insert edges, remove edges, and query a coherent answer through one Python service.</p>
    <div class="hero__cta">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href={`${base}/production/`}>Start building <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="hero__link" href={`${base}/playground/`}>Follow a real update <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__note"><span class="hero__mark" aria-hidden="true">◆</span><p><strong>1 million vertices. 10k+ durable updates/s.</strong><br />Measured with concurrent queries on the declared degree-four workload. <a href={`${base}/production/`}>See the evidence.</a></p></div>
    <p class="hero__trust mono">OPEN SOURCE &nbsp; / &nbsp; PYTHON + C++ &nbsp; / &nbsp; SQLITE</p>
  </div>
  <Replay />
</section>
<style>
  .hero { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.08fr 1fr; gap:clamp(32px,5vw,72px); align-items:center; padding-block:clamp(48px,6vw,84px); }
  .hero__content { min-width:0; }
  .hero h1 { font-size:clamp(42px,4.9vw,68px); line-height:1.04; font-weight:650; letter-spacing:-.06em; margin:26px 0; }
  .hero h1 span { color:var(--cobalt); }
  .hero__sub { max-width:490px; font-size:18px; line-height:1.65; color:var(--ink-dim); }
  .hero__cta { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:24px; margin:30px 0; }
  .hero__link { font-size:14px; font-weight:600; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong); padding-block:8px; }
  .hero__link:hover { color:var(--cobalt); }
  .hero__note { display:flex; gap:14px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:24px; max-width:500px; }
  .hero__mark { color:var(--amber); font-size:24px; }
  .hero__note p { margin:0; font-size:12px; line-height:1.7; color:var(--ink-dim); }
  .hero__note strong { color:var(--ink); font-size:14px; font-weight:600; }
  .hero__note a { text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:3px; }
  .hero__trust { margin:26px 0 0; color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.05em; }
  @media(max-width:860px) { .hero { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:36px; } .hero__content { max-width:650px; } }
  @media(max-width:360px) { .hero h1 { font-size:36px; } .hero__sub { font-size:16px; } }
</style>
